<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <!-- Google tag (gtag.js) -->
    <script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-YZ7SH1JBXG"></script>
    <script>
      window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
      function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
      gtag('js', new Date());

      gtag('config', 'G-YZ7SH1JBXG');
    </script>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>競艇直前物理AI - リアルタイム展開予測ダッシュボード</title>
    <!-- Favicon -->
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="favicon.png">
    <!-- Goolge Fonts -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700;900&family=Outfit:wght@400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Tailwind CSS via CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>

    <style>
        body {
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #1e293b 0%, #020617 100%);
            background-attachment: fixed;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            color: #f8fafc;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }
        .glass {
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9));
            backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        .glow-green {
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);
        }
        .glow-red {
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.35);
        }
        /* Boatrace Official Color Badges */
        .boat-1 { background-color: #ffffff; color: #1e293b; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; }
        .boat-2 { background-color: #1e293b; color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #475569; }
        .boat-3 { background-color: #ef4444; color: #ffffff; }
        .boat-4 { background-color: #3b82f6; color: #ffffff; }
        .boat-5 { background-color: #eab308; color: #1e293b; }
        .boat-6 { background-color: #10b981; color: #ffffff; }
        
        /* Slit Simulation Styling */
        .slit-line {
            border-left: 2px dashed rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.7);
        }
        @keyframes scan {
            0% { top: 0%; opacity: 0; }
            10% { opacity: 1; }
            90% { opacity: 1; }
            100% { top: 100%; opacity: 0; }
        }
        /* AdMax Blur/Unlock style - Premium UI Enhancement */
        .premium-blur {
            filter: blur(8px) grayscale(40%) contrast(0.8);
            opacity: 0.85;
            user-select: none;
            pointer-events: none;
            transition: all 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            position: relative;
        }
        .premium-blur::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.05) 0%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.2) 100%);
            z-index: 10;
        }
        .premium-blur .boat-1,
        .premium-blur .boat-2,
        .premium-blur .boat-3,
        .premium-blur .boat-4,
        .premium-blur .boat-5,
        .premium-blur .boat-6 {
            background-color: #475569 !important;
            color: #475569 !important;
            border-color: #475569 !important;
            box-shadow: none !important;
        }
        .premium-unlocked {
            filter: blur(0px);
        }
        
        /* Recommend Skip Decoupling Blur */
        #data-container.recommend-skip > *:not(#skip-overlay) {
            filter: blur(12px) grayscale(50%);
            pointer-events: none;
            opacity: 0.8;
            transition: all 0.5s ease;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen pb-12 antialiased">

    <!-- TOP HEADER -->
    <header class="fixed top-0 left-0 w-full z-50 px-4 py-3 glass border-b border-white/5 shadow-lg">
        <div class="max-w-md mx-auto flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse glow-green"></div>
                <h1 class="text-lg font-bold font-outfit tracking-tight bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-slate-200 to-slate-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">競艇直前物理AI</h1>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="flex flex-col items-end mr-2 cursor-pointer group relative">
                    <span class="text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-bold tracking-wider">💰 防衛実績 (本日)</span>
                    <span id="header-defense-fund" class="text-[13px] font-black font-outfit text-emerald-400 leading-none">¥0</span>
                    
                    <!-- ツールチップ（内訳表示） -->
                    <div class="absolute top-full right-0 mt-2 w-36 bg-slate-800/95 border border-slate-700/50 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg p-2.5 shadow-2xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-none z-50 text-[10px] transform translate-y-1 group-hover:translate-y-0">
                        <div class="text-[9px] text-slate-400 mb-1.5 pb-1 border-b border-white/10 text-center font-bold">防衛内訳 (機会損失相殺)</div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-emerald-400 mb-1"><span>✅ 成功</span><span id="tt-defense-success" class="font-mono font-bold">+¥0</span></div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-rose-400"><span>❌ 損失</span><span id="tt-defense-loss" class="font-mono font-bold">¥0</span></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div id="last-update" class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono">未接続</div>
                <button id="header-login-btn" onclick="window.showLoginModal()" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800/80 border border-white/10 hover:bg-slate-700 transition-colors shadow-sm focus:outline-none text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-200">
                    <span id="header-login-icon">🔑</span>
                    <span id="header-login-text">ログイン</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-md mx-auto px-4 mt-16 space-y-4">

        <!-- ★ ALWAYS-VISIBLE GAS ERROR BANNER (replaces full-page blocker) -->
        <div id="gas-error-banner" class="hidden items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-rose-950/60 border border-rose-500/20 text-[10px] text-rose-300">
            <span class="shrink-0">⚠️</span>
            <span class="flex-1">サーバー接続中... 予想データの取得に時間がかかっています。</span>
            <button onclick="initApp()" class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 bg-rose-800/60 hover:bg-rose-700/60 rounded-lg font-bold transition-colors">再試行</button>
        </div>

        <!-- ★ HERO SECTION - Always visible, no auth needed -->
        <section id="hero-section" class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden relative" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 50%, #0f172a 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);">
            <!-- Animated grid background -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(16,185,129,0.15) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(16,185,129,0.15) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;"></div>
            <div class="relative p-5 space-y-4">
                <!-- Badge -->
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 border border-emerald-500/30 text-[9px] font-black text-emerald-400 tracking-widest uppercase">AI Powered</span>
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/15 border border-indigo-500/30 text-[9px] font-black text-indigo-400">全国24場対応</span>
                </div>
                <!-- Title -->
                <div class="space-y-1">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-white leading-tight font-outfit">競艇直前展示を<br><span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 to-teal-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">AIが物理解析</span>して<br>投資判断を自動化</h2>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Gemini 2.5 Flash × LightGBM の二段階エンジンが、スリット・展示タイム・チルト・機力データを統合解析。全レース自動監視・見送りAI込みで<span class="text-white font-bold">月500円</span>。</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Stats row -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-center">
                    <div class="bg-slate-950/60 rounded-xl p-2.5 border border-white/5">
                        <div class="text-base font-black font-outfit text-emerald-400">24場</div>
                        <div class="text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-bold">全場対応</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-950/60 rounded-xl p-2.5 border border-white/5">
                        <div class="text-base font-black font-outfit text-amber-400">AI自動</div>
                        <div class="text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-bold">見送り判定</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-950/60 rounded-xl p-2.5 border border-white/5">
                        <div class="text-base font-black font-outfit text-indigo-400">¥500</div>
                        <div class="text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-bold">月額 / 解約自由</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- CTA -->
                <button onclick="window._ga4Event('premium_cta_click', {location: 'hero'}); window.showLoginModal();" class="w-full py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-400 hover:to-teal-500 text-white font-black text-sm rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-all active:scale-[0.98] font-outfit">
                    🔐 無料で読む → ログイン / 登録
                </button>
                <p class="text-center text-[8px] text-slate-600">クレジットカード不要・Stripeで安全決済・いつでも解約可</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SELECTOR PANEL (STATION & RACE) -->
        <section class="p-4 rounded-2xl glass space-y-4 shadow-md">

            <!-- INFO DASHBOARD -->
            <div id="info-dashboard" class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-600/50 mb-3 shadow-md">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-2 text-slate-200 font-bold text-[11px] font-outfit tracking-wider">
                    <span>ℹ️ お知らせ</span>
                </div>
                <ul id="news-list-container" class="text-[10px] text-slate-300 space-y-2.5 list-none pl-0">
                    <li class="text-slate-500 text-center py-2 animate-pulse">お知らせ取得中...</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- TODAY'S STATS CARD (GLOBAL RECOVERY & HIT RATE) - MOVED TO TOP -->
            <div id="today-stats-card" class="hidden p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/40 border border-white/5 space-y-2.5 mb-3">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-[10px] font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-400 uppercase font-outfit">🏆 本日のAIトータル成績</span>
                    <span id="stats-progress-badge" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] font-black bg-slate-900 text-slate-400">0 / 0 レース確定</span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                    <!-- 本命成績 -->
                    <div class="bg-indigo-500/5 p-2 rounded-lg border border-indigo-500/10 text-center space-y-1">
                        <span class="text-[9px] text-indigo-400 font-bold block">🔥 本命推奨</span>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1 border-t border-indigo-500/5 pt-1 mt-1">
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-[8px] text-slate-500 block">回収率</span>
                                <div id="stats-solid-recovery" class="text-xs font-black font-outfit text-slate-300">--%</div>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-[8px] text-slate-500 block">的中率</span>
                                <div id="stats-solid-hit" class="text-xs font-black font-outfit text-slate-300">--%</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- 穴成績 -->
                    <div class="bg-purple-500/5 p-2 rounded-lg border border-purple-500/10 text-center space-y-1">
                        <span class="text-[9px] text-purple-400 font-bold block">⚡ 穴推奨</span>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1 border-t border-purple-500/5 pt-1 mt-1">
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-[8px] text-slate-500 block">回収率</span>
                                <div id="stats-upset-recovery" class="text-xs font-black font-outfit text-slate-300">--%</div>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-[8px] text-slate-500 block">的中率</span>
                                <div id="stats-upset-hit" class="text-xs font-black font-outfit text-slate-300">--%</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[9px] text-slate-400 border-t border-white/5 pt-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                        <span>トータル収支:</span>
                        <span id="stats-net-profit" class="font-bold font-outfit text-slate-300">±0円</span>
                    </div>
                    <button id="toggle-history-btn" class="flex items-center gap-1 font-bold hover:text-slate-200 transition-colors focus:outline-none">
                        <span>詳細履歴</span>
                        <span id="history-arrow" class="transition-transform duration-200 inline-block">▼</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
                
                <div id="history-list-container" class="hidden mt-1 max-h-32 overflow-y-auto space-y-1 pr-1 scrollbar-thin scrollbar-thumb-slate-800">
                    <div class="text-[9px] text-slate-500 text-center py-2">確定結果はまだありません。</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 全国24場グリッド -->
            <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                    <label class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1">
                        🏁 全国24場 開催状況
                    </label>
                    <span class="text-[9px] bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-500/10">緑枠：本日開催</span>
                </div>
                <div id="venue-grid" class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-1 p-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl border border-white/5 text-center">
                    <!-- 24場がJavaScriptで動的に生成されます -->
                </div>
                <!-- 既存JSロジック互換用の隠し入力 -->
                <input type="hidden" id="jcd-select" value="14">
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1">
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">レース番号選択</label>
                    <select id="rno-select" class="w-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-white/10 rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-black text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500/50 transition-colors">
                        <option value="1" selected>1 R</option>
                        <option value="2">2 R</option>
                        <option value="3">3 R</option>
                        <option value="4">4 R</option>
                        <option value="5">5 R</option>
                        <option value="6">6 R</option>
                        <option value="7">7 R</option>
                        <option value="8">8 R</option>
                        <option value="9">9 R</option>
                        <option value="10">10 R</option>
                        <option value="11">11 R</option>
                        <option value="12">12 R</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- REFRESH BUTTON -->
            <button id="refresh-btn" class="w-full h-11 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-400 hover:to-teal-500 text-white font-bold text-sm rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-lg transition-all transform active:scale-95 duration-200">
                <svg id="spinner" class="w-4 h-4 text-white animate-spin hidden" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <circle class="opacity-25" cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"></circle>
                    <path class="opacity-75" fill="currentColor" d="M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4zm2 5.291A7.962 7.001 0 014 12H0c0 3.042 1.135 5.824 3 7.938l3-2.647z"></path>
                </svg>
                <span id="btn-text">🔄 最新データを表示</span>
            </button>
        </section>


        <!-- MAIN SCREEN (INITIAL STATE - HIDDEN BY DEFAULT FOR AUTO-LOAD UX) -->
        <div id="welcome-message" class="hidden p-8 rounded-2xl glass text-center space-y-3">
            <div class="text-4xl">🏁</div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">データをロードしてください</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">上の更新ボタンを押すと、キャッシュされた直前展示データと番組基本データが全自動でマージされます。</p>
        </div>

        <!-- PREMIUM AI LOADING STATE (ACTIVE BY DEFAULT) -->
        <div id="loading-skeleton" class="space-y-4">
            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl glass border border-emerald-500/30 glow-green relative overflow-hidden">
                <!-- Scanning laser effect -->
                <div class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-[2px] bg-emerald-500/50 shadow-[0_0_10px_#10b981] animate-[scan_2s_ease-in-out_infinite]"></div>
                
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center space-y-4 relative z-10">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 relative">
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border-t-2 border-emerald-400 animate-spin"></div>
                        <div class="absolute inset-2 rounded-full border-r-2 border-teal-300 animate-[spin_1.5s_linear_infinite_reverse]"></div>
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 text-xs font-black font-mono">AI</div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="text-center space-y-1">
                        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-400 tracking-widest uppercase">Deep Data Analysis</h3>
                        <p id="loading-progress-text" class="text-[10px] text-slate-300 font-mono h-4">[1/4] 過去180日の条件合致DBと照合中...</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- Progress Bar -->
                    <div class="w-full h-1.5 bg-slate-900 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                        <div id="loading-progress-bar" class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-500 to-emerald-400 w-1/4 transition-all duration-500 ease-out"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Skeleton placeholders for content -->
            <div class="p-4 bg-slate-800/40 rounded-2xl animate-pulse border border-white/5 space-y-3">
                <div class="h-4 bg-slate-700/60 rounded-full w-2/3"></div>
                <div class="space-y-2">
                    <div class="h-3 bg-slate-700/40 rounded-full"></div>
                    <div class="h-3 bg-slate-700/40 rounded-full w-5/6"></div>
                    <div class="h-3 bg-slate-700/40 rounded-full w-4/5"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-slate-800/40 rounded-2xl animate-pulse border border-white/5 space-y-4">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div class="h-4 bg-slate-700/60 rounded-full w-1/3"></div>
                    <div class="h-3 bg-slate-700/40 rounded-full w-1/4"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-slate-700/50 rounded-full"></div>
                        <div class="flex-1 space-y-2">
                            <div class="h-3 bg-slate-700/40 rounded-full w-3/4"></div>
                            <div class="h-2.5 bg-slate-700/20 rounded-full w-1/2"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-slate-700/50 rounded-full"></div>
                        <div class="flex-1 space-y-2">
                            <div class="h-3 bg-slate-700/40 rounded-full w-2/3"></div>
                            <div class="h-2.5 bg-slate-700/20 rounded-full w-1/3"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ローディング中バナー広告枠 -->
            <div class="w-full flex justify-center py-2 min-h-[60px] bg-slate-900/40 rounded-xl border border-white/5 items-center relative">
                <span class="absolute top-0.5 left-1.5 text-[7px] text-slate-600">Sponsored</span>
                <!-- admax -->
                <script src="https://adm.shinobi.jp/s/b4b8bf335cd1cf7ce012ef5a8eb6cd24"></script>
                <!-- admax -->
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CONNECTION ERROR: lightweight inline card (below selector, always dismissable) -->
        <div id="connection-error-card" class="hidden p-4 rounded-2xl glass border border-rose-500/20 bg-rose-950/10 shadow-lg">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-2xl">⚠️</span>
                <div class="flex-1 space-y-2">
                    <p class="text-xs font-bold text-rose-400">データ同期エラー</p>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">GASとの通信に失敗しました。予想データが表示されない場合は再試行してください。収支実績・免責事項・規約は下のセクションで確認できます。</p>
                    <div class="flex gap-2 pt-1">
                        <button id="retry-conn-btn" class="flex-1 h-8 bg-rose-700/60 hover:bg-rose-600/60 text-white font-bold text-[10px] rounded-lg transition-all active:scale-95">🔄 再試行</button>
                        <button id="demo-mode-btn" class="flex-1 h-8 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 font-bold text-[10px] rounded-lg border border-white/5 transition-all active:scale-95">💻 デモ表示</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- REAL DATA WRAPPER - always visible, premium content gated inside -->
        <div id="data-container" class="space-y-4 relative">
            
            <!-- 見送り推奨時(デカップリング)のBlurオーバーレイ -->
            <div id="skip-overlay" class="hidden absolute inset-0 z-50 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 text-center">
                <div class="bg-slate-900/95 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-2xl max-w-sm w-full space-y-4">
                    <div class="text-4xl">🛡️</div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-white tracking-tight">AI 見送り推奨</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                        このレースはすべての買い目の期待値(EV)が基準値を下回っており、長期的には利益が見込めません。
                    </p>
                    <p id="skip-avoided-loss" class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-300 mt-2"></p>
